:: Title [title checker nobr]  {"position":"100,100"}
<div class="title-screen">
	<h1><<print Story.name>></h1>
	<p>
		<<link "Start" "Layout 0">><</link>>
		<<if Save.browser.size > 0>> · <<link "Load">><<run UI.saves()>>><</link>><</if>>
	</p>
	<!-- Licence terms, not decoration: the letter sounds and the checkerboard
	     background are both CC BY 4.0, and their attributions belong where a
	     player can see them (docs/adr/0002). The visual-design reference is
	     cited alongside them. -->
	<p class="title-credit">Letter sounds: <a href="https://github.com/jeff-hykin/animalese" target="_blank" rel="noopener">animalese</a>, after Josh Simmons' recording (CC BY 4.0).</p>
	<p class="title-credit">Background: scrolling checkerboard pattern by <a href="https://codepen.io/liamj/pen/GRGRgMj" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Liam J</a> (CC BY 4.0), adapted.</p>
	<p class="title-credit">Speech balloon art: <a href="https://justajoke.itch.io/pixel-speech-balloon" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Pixel Speech Balloon</a> by JustAJoke, adapted.</p>
	<p class="title-credit">Visual design after Tokimeki Memorial (Konami, 1994): setting, title, Cam and the dialogue borders.</p>
</div>
